        "TileImage": "$($repository 1289b7a5-4639-45b4-a889-fa4f66078414).Image",
        "Description": "Your target is an infamous serial killer called Dexter Morgan. Mr. Morgan has gone undercover in Italy with the alias of &quot;Araldo Labate&quot;\rHe is dangerous and has over 240 confirmed kills with his other alias &quot;The Bay Harbour Butcher.&quot; \rYour Second target is Detective Miguel Anzaldo who is trying to capture Mr. Morgan. Our client does not want Mr. Anzaldo to have the honor to catch Mr. Morgan so you will have to take care of his job.\rI shall leave you to prepare",
